<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 01:47:58 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>前中央情报局官员被发现持有价值 4000 万美元的金条用于“工作相关费用”，达成初步认罪协议</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/former-cia-official-40-million-gold-bars-work-related-expenses-plea-deal/</link><description>调查人员搜查了拉什的家，查获了约 300 根金条，价值超过 4000 万美元，另外还有约 200 万美元的美元和约 35 块豪华手表。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26255743134717-e1789255980779.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 23:37:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/former-cia-official-40-million-gold-bars-work-related-expenses-plea-deal/</guid></item><item><title>美国柴油价格现在比伊朗战争前高出 60%，一位特朗普选民为他的农场设备支付了两倍的费用</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/diesel-prices-trump-iran-war-farmers-costs-fertilizer-chemicals/</link><description>49 岁的库尔茨表示，今年他的财务状况“已经很紧张”，因为他还必须支付更多的化肥和化学品费用。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26254548547470.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 23:27:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/diesel-prices-trump-iran-war-farmers-costs-fertilizer-chemicals/</guid></item><item><title>研究称，随着销售量跌至 31 年来的最低点，抵押贷款标准如此严格，购房者必须拥有“原始”信用记录</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/housing-market-mortgage-lending-standards-credit-scores-histories-home-sales-borrowing-costs/</link><description>“这些变化有助于减少拖欠和违约，但也使许多美国人更难获得抵押贷款。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2274954479-e1789247960781.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 23:04:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/housing-market-mortgage-lending-standards-credit-scores-histories-home-sales-borrowing-costs/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普童年时期的家去年以 835,000 美元的价格买下，当时它是一个长满霉菌的野猫巢穴，之后以 190 万美元的价格出售</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/trump-childhood-home-sale-price-2-million-queens-jamaica-estates/</link><description>汤米·林 (Tommy Lin) 去年以 835,000 美元的价格购买了这套五居室、三浴室的房屋，此前该房屋空置并无人管理多年。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26255612827177-e1789245578170.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 20:45:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/trump-childhood-home-sale-price-2-million-queens-jamaica-estates/</guid></item><item><title>对加拿大的贸易逆差令特朗普如此不安，原因是美国以折扣价向中西部地区购买原油。 “这是他们唯一可以使用的石油”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/trade-deficit-canada-tariffs-trump-alberta-oil-imports-discount-midwest-refineries/</link><description>“他们不能使用德克萨斯州原油。他们不能使用委内瑞拉原油。他们没有做好准备。这需要数年时间和数十亿美元才能转移。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26234554216194-e1789244943811.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 20:36:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/trade-deficit-canada-tariffs-trump-alberta-oil-imports-discount-midwest-refineries/</guid></item><item><title>供应链专家：联邦快递首席执行官 Raj Subramaniam 如何引领“再全球化”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/27/fedex-ceo-raj-subramaniam-supply-chain-reglobalization-tariffs-iran/</link><description>关税、冲突和贸易路线的变化正在颠覆世界各地的货物流动。拉吉·苏布拉马尼亚姆 (Raj Subramaniam) 认为联邦快递可以利用这次中断来发挥自己的优势。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/FedEx-social-thumbnail.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 15:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/27/fedex-ceo-raj-subramaniam-supply-chain-reglobalization-tariffs-iran/</guid></item><item><title>一本启发沃伦·巴菲特的书和 14,000 美元的副业如何帮助亿万富翁比尔·阿克曼开始成为一名投资者</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/how-a-book-that-inspired-warren-buffett-and-a-14000-side-hustle-helped-billionaire-bill-ackman-get-started-as-an-investor/</link><description>潘兴广场资本管理公司首席执行官比尔·阿克曼表示，他在父亲的房地产公司工作后受到启发，成为一名投资者。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/BillAckman-e1786376698511.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 16:44:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/how-a-book-that-inspired-warren-buffett-and-a-14000-side-hustle-helped-billionaire-bill-ackman-get-started-as-an-investor/</guid></item><item><title>比尔·阿克曼 (Bill Ackman) 的 350 亿美元对冲基金拥有不到 50 名员工，从门卫到接待员，所有人都拥有数百万股公司股票</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/bill-ackmans-35-billion-hedge-fund-has-under-50-employees-and-all-of-them-from-janitors-to-receptionists-own-millions-in-company-stock/</link><description>亿万富翁投资者比尔·阿克曼表示，员工忠诚度会带来红利，他愿意投资数百万美元购买股票奖励，并允许夏季远程工作来赚取红利。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/BIllAckman-interview.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 11:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/bill-ackmans-35-billion-hedge-fund-has-under-50-employees-and-all-of-them-from-janitors-to-receptionists-own-millions-in-company-stock/</guid></item><item><title>比尔·阿克曼同意杰夫·贝佐斯的观点：成为一名伟大的首席执行官可以为世界做的不仅仅是慈善事业</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/07/bill-ackman-philanthropy-capitalism-jeff-bezos/</link><description>这位对冲基金亿万富翁已经做了 20 年的慈善家，他告诉《财富》杂志，“在解决问题方面，它的效率远远低于资本主义”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Bill-Ackman-social-thumbnail-e1784631339512.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 19:07:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/07/bill-ackman-philanthropy-capitalism-jeff-bezos/</guid></item><item><title>“社会主义是一场灾难”：比尔·阿克曼说佐兰·马丹尼糟糕的左翼住房政策正在加剧纽约的负担能力危机</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/05/socialism-disaster-ackman-mamdani-left-wing-housing-policy-affordability/</link><description>阿克曼告诉《财富》杂志：“左翼市长让开发商在这里建房变得非常困难。”他强调肯·格里芬是一个关键的例子。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/GettyImages-2273985119-e1778857565328.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 17:29:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/05/socialism-disaster-ackman-mamdani-left-wing-housing-policy-affordability/</guid></item></channel></rss>